        "value": "Government-led initiatives are opening sectors such as tourism, entertainment, and technology for private and foreign investment"
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "value": "Saudi Arabia offers access to one of the largest consumer markets in the Middle East, with strong purchasing power"
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "value": "Located at the centre of global trade routes, enabling easy access to Asia, Europe, and Africa"
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "value": "Various incentives, including tax benefits, funding programmes, and industrial support for strategic sectors"
      },
